  VALUES ('cmsgrciria4424w45hsn1', 'Metropolitan Garden Design', 'metropolitan-garden-design-b7539b', 'landscaping', '\+1 347-325-1720', 'info@metropolitangardendesign.com', 'http://www.metropolitangardendesign.com/', '22 E 88th St, New York, NY 10128', 'US', 'USD', 'New York', 'NY', '10128', 40.7819881, -73.9584149, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.9, 55, 'Metropolitan Garden Design — landscaping in New York', '<p>is a full service urban landscape design and construction company specializing in New York City outdoor spaces. Our projects, both commercial and residential, include rooftops, terraces, backyards and sidewalk plantings. We use only the best available plants and hardscape materials for your garden. Our custom drip irrigation systems provide ease of maintenance to the busy New Yorker and our landscape lighting allows for nighttime enjoyment. We pride ourselves on providing the highest quality workmanship, completing your project in a timely and professional manner. Have us transform your outdoor space and keep it looking great throughout the year.</p>
<p>Our garden design professionals understand the NYC landscape; we have a passion for turning our client’s urban dwellings into a lush, green landscape to enjoy gardening, sunbathing or grilling during the warm city nights. Even in the cooler months, we are qualified to maintain your garden with seasonal plantings so that your garden never goes dull or dead. We also understand that you are busy and provide garden maintenance packages so that your urban oasis never falters; these services include a range of items, from…</p>', 'Metropolitan Garden Design — landscaping in New York | Fieseros', 'Book Metropolitan Garden Design for landscaping services in New York. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (55 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:28.158Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 5, 'ChIJYzRCIuNYwokR7BSfg1opc_M', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.264Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.264Z')
