  VALUES ('cmsgrcka6oasqzivb4i48', 'Anthony & Sons Landscapers', 'anthony-sons-landscapers-dbb70b', 'landscaping', '\+1 917-559-2090', NULL, 'http://aslandscapedesign.com/', '151-08 6th Rd, Whitestone, NY 11357', 'US', 'USD', NULL, 'NY', '11357', 40.7958128, -73.812788, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 5, 52, 'Anthony & Sons Landscapers — landscaping', '<p>Enhance your business. Transform an outdoor space so that your clients have a place to relax and unwind.</p>
<p>Upgrade your lifestyle. Change your backyard into an outdoor living space so that you have another place to relax and unwind after work.</p>
<p>Professional landscaping showcases a homeowner''s personality and lifestyle. It says something to the neighborhood that the inside of your home just can''t do. So why not take the time to have your yard done right? Our company looks at each piece of property as a canvas that needs to be completed. Our job, of course, is to add color, texture, and shapes that highlight the already existing beauty. Whether it is a new driveway or a beautiful outdoor living space, our design professionals can assist you in discovering the potential of your grounds.</p>
<p>Our services include commercial landscaping maintenance, residential landscaping, weekly maintenance, snow removal, and any other outdoor work that you can dream up. No matter what the project entails, as the most professional providers of landscaping Queens NY has, we are dedicated to exceeding your expectations. Astonish the neighbors. Give your customers a great first…</p>', 'Anthony & Sons Landscapers — landscaping | Fieseros', 'Book Anthony & Sons Landscapers for landscaping services in your area. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (52 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:30.126Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 3, 'ChIJx48pTemKwokRAefmhFoobgs', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.265Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.265Z')
