<p>Explore our portfolio of select landscape design projects completed throughout Manhattan and Brooklyn, featuring modern backyards, terraces and rooftop gardens in NYC, Brooklyn & Long Island. Select a project to view a full gallery & additional project details.</p>
<p>This loft-like brownstone in Brooklyn, New York needed a landscape that could stand up to it’s massive character. Our clients wanted a wide open space for their 2 children and 2 golden labs to play. Seating and grilling areas were requested, along with a need for good drainage.</p>
<p>We build and install our landscape designs locally in NYC, Brooklyn, Queens and beyond. The process starts with an on-site consultation, but If you''re not within our reach, we can still work with you to develop a landscape design to suit your outdoor space, with a full design…</p>', 'New Eco Landscapes — landscaping | Fieseros', 'Book New Eco Landscapes for landscaping services in your area. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (18 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:29.080Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 2, 'ChIJX8QdO09awokRHDfrCOmhA7E', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.265Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.265Z')
