<p>We provide a variety of Design Packages, DIY Guides featuring a selection of plants and features for diverse landscape styles, and a handpicked collection of native plants, furniture, and other elements.</p>
<p>Julie lives and works in New York City. A native New Yorker, her focus is on residential gardens in New York City, Connecticut, and the East End of Long Island.</p>
<p>She has received many awards, including The Architectural Masterprize, The Architizer Award, as well as the AIA Brooklyn and Connecticut Awards for her work as a landscape designer. She currently resides in Brooklyn with her husband and two children.</p>', 'Landstylist: Landscape Design — landscaping | Fieseros', 'Book Landstylist: Landscape Design for landscaping services in your area. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (27 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:28.684Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 13, 'ChIJCbfUB0lawokRvZm93PN8n2I', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.265Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.265Z')
