<p>At JC Landscaping & Design, we create captivating outdoor spaces tailored to your…</p>', 'JC Landscaping & Design, Inc. — landscaping | Fieseros', 'Book JC Landscaping & Design, Inc. for landscaping services in your area. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.5★ (42 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:28.817Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 1, 'ChIJz1g164pewokRAdQbeiE8x9E', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.266Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.266Z')
