<p>No two landscapes are alike, and we approach every project with a custom process. From lush greenery to elegant hardscaping, our team ensures each design blends seamlessly with your space while maximizing beauty and functionality. We work with homeowners, businesses, and property managers to create and maintain breathtaking outdoor experiences that thrive in the unique climate of New York City.</p>
<p>Keep your garden vibrant and healthy with our expert maintenance services. From pruning and mulching to pest control and fertilization, our team ensures your outdoor space remains in peak condition throughout the seasons. Whether you need weekly upkeep or seasonal…</p>', 'NY Horticulture Group: NYC Landscape Design — landscaping in New York', 'Book NY Horticulture Group: NYC Landscape Design for landscaping services in New York. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ ', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:28.631Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 1, 'ChIJb1sQl7xZwokREH-fDFr26fo', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.266Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.266Z')
  ON CONFLICT ("googlePlaceId") DO NOTHING;

