<p>This penthouse terrace runs the full length of the apartment, so we started out with the vision of making the terrace truly feel like an extension of the indoor space, just a few steps away. We created outdoor living, dining and kitchen areas, complete with a gas grill, surrounded by a garden of trees, evergreens and perennials.</p>
<p>Watch the before and after transformations from five of our favorite projects from 2023.</p>
<p>We did ivy on ivy on ivy at this gorgeous beaux arts townhouse on East 61st Street for Casa Cruz. Five terraces and a rooftop full of greenery for guests to enjoy. Recently opened in…</p>', 'Birch and Basil Design — landscaping in New York | Fieseros', 'Book Birch and Basil Design for landscaping services in New York. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (20 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:28.810Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 5, 'ChIJZWbpGvFZwokRTz9rwHUAQCY', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.266Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:30.266Z')
