  VALUES ('cmsgrclh2xdstk5m51msn', 'New York Plantings', 'new-york-plantings-e1af0f', 'landscaping', '\+1 646-434-8049', 'info@newyorkplantings.com', 'https://newyorkplantings.com/drip-irrigation-systems', '333 E 14th St, New York, NY 10003', 'US', 'USD', 'New York', 'NY', '10003', 40.7318376, -73.9832555, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.4, 14, 'New York Plantings — landscaping in New York', '<p>Contact us by phone: 646 434 8049 text: 347 558 7051 or email info@newyorkplantings.com</p>
<p>The ability for a automatic garden watering system to protect your landscape design or rooftop garden with installation of a drip irrigation system will be the very best way to ensure a successful landscape of garden. The challenging conditions of a New York City roof or terrace garden require more frequent watering at the right times of day due to intense sun, heat and high winds that can dry soil and desiccate your landscape plantings. Whether a townhouse rear yard, a public courtyard or a rooftop garden irrigation system the drip watering will not only protect your landscape design trees, shrubs, and flowers by providing the right amount of water at the optimal times of day the automatic smart drip irrigation system controller will help save water. Your NYC outdoor space will remain green and trees or shrubs remain healthy. However some may consider, finding the time hand water is difficult. Then, we also want the optimal soil moisture levels for root growth and an established garden. Luckily, at New York Plantings Irrigation and Landscape Lighting NYC we offer drip irrigation…</p>', 'New York Plantings — landscaping in New York | Fieseros', 'Book New York Plantings for landscaping services in New York. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.4★ (14 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:31.670Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 6, 'ChIJpctLQS5ZwokRA6kd3tUuWQI', '2026-08-06T00:08:44.418Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:44.418Z')
  ON CONFLICT ("googlePlaceId") DO NOTHING;

