<p>Dogs and other pets can wreak havoc on traditional grass surfaces, but not with highly durable artificial pet turf from SYNLawn New York! Our soft, easy-to-clean synthetic pet grass is ideal for household pets and dog…</p>', 'SYNLawn New York — landscaping in New York | Fieseros', 'Book SYNLawn New York for landscaping services in New York. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (43 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:34.360Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 13, 'ChIJAfIx8yBawokRx33R6zk2174', '2026-08-06T00:08:44.419Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:44.419Z')
