  VALUES ('cmsgrckvfj3exk8xdi2ll', 'Our Temenos', 'our-temenos-3d73b6', 'landscaping', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.ourtemenos.org/', '454 Lafayette Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11238', 'US', 'USD', NULL, 'NY', '11238', 40.6890487, -73.9569229, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.8, 17, 'Our Temenos — landscaping', '<p>Our Temenos offers thoughtful garden and landscape design through an ecological lens. Our practice leans toward native and naturalistic plantings, but also accommodates formal aesthetic where necessary. We prioritize permeable hardscaping to manage storm water, biodegradable materials that are renewable, upcycling where possible, and consider the life-cycle cost for clients, workers and the environment every step of the way.</p>
<p>Our Temenos gardens and landscapes are installed by green economy professionals, which is not industry standard. The difference this makes in the success of our gardens is palpable. Our Temenos also extends our philosophy of sustainability and responsible stewardship to our woodwork and hardscape offerings. We offer fences, planters and patios that are designed and built with local materials and the most sustainable options available.</p>
<p>Are you tired of seeing the garden hacked to bits in an effort to clean and preen the grounds of your business, co-op or public institution? Our Temenos offers garden and grounds maintenance executed by horticulture professionals. Our landscape management plans are always chemical free for the health of the our…</p>', 'Our Temenos — landscaping | Fieseros', 'Book Our Temenos for landscaping services in your area. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (17 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:30.891Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 13, 'ChIJAUTAW_oOkCIR5_IMv3rLI9o', '2026-08-06T00:08:44.419Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:44.419Z')
  ON CONFLICT ("googlePlaceId") DO NOTHING;

