<p>Founded in 2015, Artscape Gardens began with a mission to help Angelenos convert their lawns into beautiful, drought-tolerant oases. We specialize in California-friendly plant orchestrations that highlight native and water-wise themes—creating outdoor spaces that are both functional and visually compelling.</p>
<p>Beyond planting, we also provide hardscape services including walls, concrete, fences, and more. Quality craftsmanship is central to everything we do, and we hold every build to the highest…</p>', 'Artscape Gardens — landscaping in Los Angeles | Fieseros', 'Book Artscape Gardens for landscaping services in Los Angeles. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (45 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:53.939Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 13, 'ChIJEXJhcDfEwoARW1IzQeWAptk', '2026-08-06T00:08:57.850Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:57.850Z')
