<p>Complete Front Yard & Backyard Landscaping & RemodelingThe front of your house should be complimented with your personal style while still being welcoming to visitors.</p>
<p>We specialize in energy efficiency in all aspects of remodeling. Outdoor energy efficient projects encompass drought tolerant landscaping to replace old grass areas or a complete innovative design layout with greenery, trees, and beautiful plants; many of which qualify for significant water savings and city program rebates (based on area and project).</p>
<p>Exterior yard lighting, walkways, pavers and stone are the best way to carve your path and create a style all your own. We utilize stepping stones, river rock, decomposed granite and brick/ stone planters or even wall tiering to compliment your space.</p>
<p>We will complete any yard with drainage and new irrigation/water sprinkler systems to provide proper care for your lawn, sod, and shrubbery.</p>
<p>This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.</p>', 'Ariel Builders Landscape Specialist — landscaping in Marina del Rey |', 'Book Ariel Builders Landscape Specialist for landscaping services in Marina del Rey. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (1', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:52.826Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 15, 'ChIJzy_4tZe7woARESGoYnfCvdY', '2026-08-06T00:08:57.850Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:57.850Z')
