<p>"Juan and his team did a really great job for me. I manage a property and the yard had been overrun with weeds, some taller than me. He came in with his guys and really spruced the place up. The best part for me was having them bag and haul everything away. He was really easy to communicate with both over text and on the phone and he and his father were both very polite in person. I would definitely recommend Juan to anyone. Easy to work with, flexible payment methods, and a great finished product."</p>
<p>"I always take my time and dive into research when hiring any professional for tasks and projects,…</p>', 'Diaz Landscaping Services — landscaping in Los Angeles | Fieseros', 'Book Diaz Landscaping Services for landscaping services in Los Angeles. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (5 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:52.668Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 7, 'ChIJSSusnXS4woAR804_yQKd8jY', '2026-08-06T00:08:57.851Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:57.851Z')
