<p>Our services are all about creating and maintaining outdoor spaces that feel just right. From dreaming up a peaceful garden design to putting each plant in its perfect spot, we make sure everything comes together effortlessly.</p>
<p>Barba Landscape has its roots in the heart of Santa Monica, where a newlywed couple''s ambition to make ends meet blossomed into a thriving business in 1991. Starting with the simple act of pushing lawn mowers side by side, my parents laid the foundation for what has grown into a reputable Landscape Design and Installation company. Over the years, we''ve learned that the key to our success lies not just in meticulous attention to detail but also in the deep, enduring relationships we build with our…</p>', 'Barba Landscape & Design — landscaping in Santa Monica | Fieseros', 'Book Barba Landscape & Design for landscaping services in Santa Monica. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (55 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:08:54.545Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 2, 'ChIJiz8gjdq6woARk4pLWreGe7I', '2026-08-06T00:08:57.851Z', '2026-08-06T00:08:57.851Z')
