<p>As pioneers in the rooftop garden design/build space, we’ve seen firsthand the incredible advances in both materials and methods to make creation of a rooftop garden easier than ever.</p>
<p>“I have been working with Chicago Specialty Gardens for almost 10 years now and can say nothing but good things. They are always responsive and respectful of my time and have beautiful, creative landscaping ideas. I have used them for every space of my home, both inside and out and will continue to be a customer of theirs for the next 10 years!”</p>
<p>“From start to finish we have had a terrific experience with the team at Chicago Specialty Gardens. They were timely with completion and the end result is spectacular. We just had our wrap up meeting and I was handed a binder and thumb drive of all instructions, warranties and contacts. In my 15 years of working with…</p>', 'Chicago Specialty Gardens, Inc. — landscaping in Chicago | Fieseros', 'Book Chicago Specialty Gardens, Inc. for landscaping services in Chicago. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.6★ (20 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:09:32.681Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 1, 'ChIJi8stadMsDogRDqKd0W-o4-k', '2026-08-06T00:09:39.607Z', '2026-08-06T00:09:39.607Z')
