<p>Hours of Operation Monday: 7:00 AM – 5:00 PM Tuesday: 7:00 AM – 5:00 PM Wednesday: 7:00 AM – 5:00 PM…</p>', 'Western DuPage Landscaping, Inc. — landscaping in Naperville | Fieser', 'Book Western DuPage Landscaping, Inc. for landscaping services in Naperville. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (65 revie', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:09:30.644Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 11, 'ChIJt354Ym_5DogRXD0arywz6jU', '2026-08-06T00:09:39.607Z', '2026-08-06T00:09:39.607Z')
