  VALUES ('cmsgre7tg2pbysacrmiq5', 'Absolute Lawn Care and Landscaping', 'absolute-lawn-care-and-landscaping-fc6831', 'landscaping', '\+1 281-713-4600', 'office@absolute-landscape.com', 'https://www.absolute-landscape.com/', '2221 Silver St, Houston, TX 77007', 'US', 'USD', 'Houston', 'TX', '77007', 29.776759600000002, -95.37739260000001, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.8, 302, 'Absolute Lawn Care and Landscaping — landscaping in Houston', '<p>Hiring a landscaping company isn''t just about keeping grass trimmed. Done right, professional care looks after the health of your lawn while creating spaces people actually want to use. Some of the benefits of professional landscaping include:</p>
