<p>We do more than just basic lawn care. Our fertilization programs give your grass the nutrients Texas soil often lacks. Mulching protects plant roots and gives your beds a neat look. Our team trims shrubs and hedges so they look clean and professional, not uneven like you often see with DIY trimming. We also install artificial turf where grass won''t grow, repair sprinkler systems, lay new sod, build retaining walls, add…</p>', 'Absolute Lawn Care and Landscaping — landscaping in Houston | Fiesero', 'Book Absolute Lawn Care and Landscaping for landscaping services in Houston. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (302 revie', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:09:47.284Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 12, 'ChIJAX2JWq_FQIYRHzZdPCdHE58', '2026-08-06T00:09:58.910Z', '2026-08-06T00:09:58.910Z')
  ON CONFLICT ("googlePlaceId") DO NOTHING;

