<p>A well-designed landscape can really augment your property, enhancing curb appeal and outdoor enjoyment. Our expert designers work closely with you to create custom landscapes that reflect your vision, whether it’s a serene garden, a modern outdoor living space, or a beautiful, green lawn. Once your design is finalized, we handle every detail of the installation, ensuring a beautiful result.</p>
<p>A healthy lawn requires ongoing care and proper irrigation. We offer professional lawn maintenance services, including mowing, edging, fertilization, and seasonal cleanups, to keep your grass green and thriving. Our sprinkler system installation and repair services ensure your lawn and plants receive the right amount of water without waste, keeping your landscape healthy all year.</p>
<p>Make the exterior property a place for rest and…</p>', 'Nature Springs Landscaping — landscaping in Houston | Fieseros', 'Book Nature Springs Landscaping for landscaping services in Houston. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (54 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:09:50.634Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 2, 'ChIJ15XPEk6_QIYRi3twq-Xsmr8', '2026-08-06T00:09:58.910Z', '2026-08-06T00:09:58.910Z')
