<p>Heaven on Earth Landscaping is not a lawn service. We are a full-service outdoor design and build studio, founded by Alfredo Lunar in 2016, dedicated to transforming properties across greater Houston into extraordinary outdoor living environments.</p>
<p>We specialize in the work that requires real artistry — custom landscape architecture, sculpted hardscaping, bespoke water features, precision drainage systems, and atmospheric outdoor lighting. Every project is designed from scratch and built with exceptional craftsmanship.</p>
<p>Six disciplines. One studio. Every project is designed from the ground up, built by hand, and guaranteed by Alfredo personally.</p>
<p>Custom residential and commercial landscape design tailored to Houston''s climate and your vision.</p>
<p>Fountains, ponds, waterfalls and custom water features that add beauty, value, and tranquility.</p>', 'Heaven On Earth Landscaping Inc. — landscaping in Houston | Fieseros', 'Book Heaven On Earth Landscaping Inc. for landscaping services in Houston. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (80 reviews)', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:09:48.697Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 13, 'ChIJ46Vds9adQIYRmSsdOhzUOO8', '2026-08-06T00:09:58.910Z', '2026-08-06T00:09:58.910Z')
