  VALUES ('cmsgrel9w5d4v53wg7zbc', 'FiveSTAR Landscape', 'fivestar-landscape-fe0cf9', 'landscaping', '\+1 713-322-9444', NULL, 'http://www.houstonfivestar.com/', '2425 W Loop S Suite 200, Houston, TX 77027', 'US', 'USD', 'Houston', 'TX', '77027', 29.742164199999998, -95.4569721, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.9, 20, 'FiveSTAR Landscape — landscaping in Houston', '<p>As an award winning Houston landscape architecture and landscape design build company, FiveSTAR Landscape specializes in comprehensive residential transformations for homeowners Inside the Loop and throughout the Beltway 8 corridor. We are a boutique, locally owned, and family-operated company dedicated to turning your outdoor space into a unique retreat. Since 2016, our mission has been to create exceptional outdoor environments that highlight the natural beauty of Texas while offering you a personal oasis in the heart of Houston.</p>
<p>Our award-winning ASLA certified Landscape Architects and landscape designers work closely with you to bring your vision to life. We focus on custom residential landscape design and build projects. At FiveSTAR Landscape, we manage the entire project lifecycle, providing you with a single, expert point of contact from the initial consultation to the final day of construction and site clean up.</p>
<p>Our integrated landscape design-build process ensures that every structural, architectural and aesthetic detail —including advanced drainage engineering and site grading— is meticulously handled. Whether you are in Rice Village, River Oaks, West…</p>', 'FiveSTAR Landscape — landscaping in Houston | Fieseros', 'Book FiveSTAR Landscape for landscaping services in Houston. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (20 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:10:04.724Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 13, 'ChIJG-B_M2vBQIYRzlfQjhi7Wr4', '2026-08-06T00:10:06.362Z', '2026-08-06T00:10:06.362Z')
