<p>Our projects typically range from $10,000 to $300,000+ , depending on scope, materials, and design complexity.</p>
<p>If you’re exploring a smaller project or a DIY-style solution, we’re happy to offer general guidance. However, our core focus is working with clients who value premium craftsmanship, professional project management, and lasting results.</p>
<p>Book an appointment with Orion Turf & Landscape for Houston premium artificial grass.</p>
<p>Our name, Orion, draws from the legendary hunter known for his strength and precision, and the Orion constellation—a symbol of guidance and brilliance. Inspired by both, Orion Turf & Landscape creates Performance Landscapes using Houston artificial grass to merge luxury, durability, and functionality—enhancing outdoor living one space at a time.</p>
<p>Our landscapes do more than look good—they change how people live. From family gatherings to kids playing safely outside, our clients share how their outdoor upgrades brought new life to their homes and routines.</p>', 'Orion Turf and Landscape — landscaping in Houston | Fieseros', 'Book Orion Turf and Landscape for landscaping services in Houston. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (166 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:10:08.334Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 1, 'ChIJW7OazrKbJ2oRwVBN4jtrzCQ', '2026-08-06T00:10:12.366Z', '2026-08-06T00:10:12.366Z')
