  VALUES ('cmsgrfa821c164l1xvkdb', 'UDS Philly Landscaping and Removal', 'uds-philly-landscaping-and-removal-83a24a', 'landscaping', '\+1 267-540-3107', 'bkeal@udsphilly.com', 'http://udsphilly.com/', '4455 N 6th St, Philadelphia, PA 19140', 'US', 'USD', 'Philadelphia', 'PA', '19140', 40.0194523, -75.1364325, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 5, 58, 'UDS Philly Landscaping and Removal — landscaping in Philadelphia', '<p>We will maintain the outdoor space so that its left looking as beautiful as it did when it was first planted.</p>
<p>Planting, shaping, and maintaining of shrubs or small trees to create a living border, screen, or decorative feature.</p>
<p>Weed and seed keeps your lawn healthy — removing weeds and feeding the grass so it grows thicker, greener, and stronger.</p>
<p>Mulch isn’t just about looks — it keeps your yard healthy. We lay fresh mulch to lock in moisture, block weeds, and give your beds a polished, low-maintenance finish.</p>
<p>From leaves to limbs, we clean it all up. Our yard cleanup service gets rid of the mess and brings your yard back to life — neat, tidy, and ready to enjoy.</p>
<p>Our spring and fall cleanup services prepare your landscape for the season ahead. In the spring, we clear away winter debris, refresh garden beds, prune plants, and get your lawn ready for growth. In the fall, we remove leaves, branches, and clutter, while preparing plants and turf for the colder months. Each cleanup leaves your property neat, healthy, and protected year-round.</p>', 'UDS Philly Landscaping and Removal — landscaping in Philadelphia | Fi', 'Book UDS Philly Landscaping and Removal for landscaping services in Philadelphia. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (58 r', '["landscaping","moving"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:10:37.058Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 9, 'ChIJEWQL1sjU9qcRu6EjqZmoME4', '2026-08-06T00:10:43.129Z', '2026-08-06T00:10:43.129Z')
