<p>A Perfect Design has not only a great appearance, but equally sound ergonomics. We feel there is a symbiotic relationship…</p>', 'Potted Perfection, LLC. — landscaping in Philadelphia | Fieseros', 'Book Potted Perfection, LLC. for landscaping services in Philadelphia. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (52 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:10:37.945Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 9, 'ChIJPZibng_GxokRiVgUfu1eYMk', '2026-08-06T00:10:43.129Z', '2026-08-06T00:10:43.129Z')
