  VALUES ('cmsgrffpa8b1aypeteyts', 'Flower Powered Landscape Design', 'flower-powered-landscape-design-722fc6', 'landscaping', '\+1 267-300-6278', NULL, 'https://www.flowerpowered.net/', '346 Meehan Ave, Philadelphia, PA 19119', 'US', 'USD', 'Philadelphia', 'PA', '19119', 40.0595575, -75.1815299, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.3, 6, 'Flower Powered Landscape Design — landscaping in Philadelphia', '<p>Whether you want to update your current landscape, maintain an existing garden, add more curb appeal or create a private backyard garden retreat, Flower Powered can tailor our residential landscaping services to accommodate a variety of spaces and circumstances.</p>
<p>Inspired by the peace that a garden can provide, we''ve created a better residential gardening and landscaping service. One built on personal relationships, solid designs and promises delivered.</p>
<p>From your front to back yard, Flower Powered wants to be your gardener of choice! Your home and gardens should be your happy place. Like interior design, Flower Powered''s exterior design service adds beauty and functionality to your outdoor environment. For a seamless flow from your home, to your gardens.</p>
<p>Curb Appeal: Enhance the beauty, safety and value of your home with foundation plants and landscape lighting.</p>
<p>Backyard Living: Entertain friends and family in a beautiful, functional and well-lit outdoor living space.</p>
<p>Seasonal Color: Celebrate each season with bulbs, annuals and customized seasonal containers and window boxes.</p>', 'Flower Powered Landscape Design — landscaping in Philadelphia | Fiese', 'Book Flower Powered Landscape Design for landscaping services in Philadelphia. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.3★ (6 revie', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:10:44.158Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 15, 'ChIJDXbUH_q5xokRhWDXGyzZp2s', '2026-08-06T00:10:49.133Z', '2026-08-06T00:10:49.133Z')
