  VALUES ('cmsgrffvfgzfo63sx4n6p', 'Roots Landscape', 'roots-landscape-3e3a13', 'landscaping', '\+1 610-964-0100', NULL, 'http://rootslandscape.com/', '485 Devon Park Dr #104, Wayne, PA 19087', 'US', 'USD', 'Wayne', 'PA', '19087', 40.0753476, -75.41463, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.6, 21, 'Roots Landscape — landscaping in Wayne', '<p>Crafting bespoke outdoor living spaces that blend form and function. From intricate stone patios to lush gardens, our residential projects elevate homes to a new level of beauty.</p>
<p>Our expert horticulturists bring artistry to your landscape, curating seasonal gardens that bloom year-round with texture, color, and interest. The result is a landscape that feels alive, intentional, and effortlessly beautiful.</p>
<p>Bringing professional elegance to commercial properties with tailored landscape designs that enhance the natural beauty and functionality of every space.</p>
<p>Our ISA certified arborists provide comprehensive outdoor care that keeps your property safe, healthy, and beautiful year-round. Services include: expert tree maintenance, pruning, safe removal, and stump grinding.</p>
<p>For over a decade, we’ve been honored as the Best of the Main Line and featured in top publications like Martha Stewart Living and House Beautiful . Recognized as the Face of Premier Landscape Design from 2022-2024, our work graces the Philadelphia area’s finest homes.</p>
<p>From historic estates to modern cityscapes, Roots Landscape creates outdoor spaces that blend elegance and…</p>', 'Roots Landscape — landscaping in Wayne | Fieseros', 'Book Roots Landscape for landscaping services in Wayne. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.6★ (21 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:10:44.379Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 15, 'ChIJL0BVGmGUxokRg1zrMS368zQ', '2026-08-06T00:10:49.134Z', '2026-08-06T00:10:49.134Z')
