<p>Ground Reconsidered is Women-Owned Business Enterprise ( WBE ) and Disadvantaged Business Enterprise ( DBE ).</p>
<p>Design and documentation of landscapes on structure, including green roofs and amenity terraces</p>
<p>Phoenixville Square: Planning for Community 2025 ASLA PA/DE Honor Award: Analysis and Planning</p>
