  VALUES ('cmsgrgfmrqurnnol6t44l', 'San Diego Landscape Remodeling', 'san-diego-landscape-remodeling-6578fe', 'landscaping', '\+1 619-613-2511', 'office@sandiegolandscaperemodeling.com', 'https://sandiegolandscaperemodeling.com/', '9019 Park Plaza Dr Ste h, La Mesa, CA 91942', 'US', 'USD', 'La Mesa', 'CA', '91942', 32.791368999999996, -117.0026061, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 5, 4, 'San Diego Landscape Remodeling — landscaping in La Mesa', '<p>Backyard transformations across San Diego County, designed and built by the same hands from first sketch to final stone.</p>
<p>Custom outdoor remodeling for San Diego homeowners who want a space worth living in — and a firm that answers the phone after the build. Trusted trade partners and our in-house team, both founders on every project, start to finish.</p>
<p>San Diego Landscape Remodeling is a curated firm — two partners, a senior field crew, and a short client list each year. Our primary work is full backyard remodels in the fifty-to-three-hundred-thousand-dollar range. We also take on scoped hardscape and structure projects when the fit is right.</p>
<p>We price every job honestly — scoped to your property, your goals, your materials — and that number doesn''t move based on who else is bidding. Design and build is our only work. We don''t split our attention.</p>
<p>Our primary work. A plan for the entire outdoor footprint, drawn by our design team, rendered so you can see the finished space before anything is broken ground, and built under dedicated senior field leadership, first cut to final clean. Most projects land between fifty and three hundred thousand dollars.</p>', 'San Diego Landscape Remodeling — landscaping in La Mesa | Fieseros', 'Book San Diego Landscape Remodeling for landscaping services in La Mesa. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (4 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:11:30.723Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 8, 'ChIJGXep9kM6IkQRDNsJP_YsRjw', '2026-08-06T00:11:36.369Z', '2026-08-06T00:11:36.369Z')
