  VALUES ('cmsgrh0xsv71cga4cl8bp', 'Terra Dura Landscapes', 'terra-dura-landscapes-14dbe1', 'landscaping', '\+1 512-400-4198', 'andrew@terra-dura.com', 'https://terra-dura.com/', '6214 N Lamar Blvd Bldg c, Austin, TX 78752', 'US', 'USD', 'Austin', 'TX', '78752', 30.331032999999998, -97.723539, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.8, 29, 'Terra Dura Landscapes — landscaping in Austin', '<p>Our Austin design team translates your vision into reality with professional site analysis and innovative 3D concepts. We focus on low-maintenance, high-impact landscapes that elevate your home’s aesthetic and long-term value.</p>
<p>From custom steel planters and masonry to limestone patios and professional landscape lighting, our build team handles it all. We specialize in durable, high-quality outdoor living installations across Central Austin .</p>
<p>Protect your investment with our specialized Austin xeriscape care . We offer customized maintenance for residential and commercial landscapes , focusing on ecological health, native plant vitality, and long-term aesthetic value.</p>
<p>At Terra Dura Landscapes, we specialize in custom outdoor living construction—patios, kitchens, fire features, and shade structures built for comfort and durability. From concept to completion, our design-build team creates functional outdoor spaces that elevate how you live outside. We also offer continued landscape care to protect your investment year-round. With a focus on quality materials, thoughtful layout, and low-maintenance plantings, including xeriscape options, we build landscapes…</p>', 'Terra Dura Landscapes — landscaping in Austin | Fieseros', 'Book Terra Dura Landscapes for landscaping services in Austin. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (29 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:11:58.336Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 12, 'ChIJv2BubtXLRIYRjHbIX8es1L8', '2026-08-06T00:12:07.863Z', '2026-08-06T00:12:07.863Z')
