<p>From vision to reality in one team. We design with precision, build with steel and concrete, and stand behind every detail. Modern outdoor living built entirely in-house—no committees, no surprises, no subcontractors for core work. Complete design-build from concept to your backyard.</p>
<p>At Red Agave we offer a wide range of services in Austin, TX. If you can dream it, we can create it.</p>
<p>At Red Agave, we don''t just landscape; we engineer luxury outdoor living environments. As Austin''s premier design-build studio, we craft bespoke exterior spaces across Westlake, Barton Creek, Tarrytown, Circle C, and the Texas Hill Country. From resort-scale pool surrounds and architectural hardscaping to custom fire features and cedar pergolas, our work is defined by precision. By managing every phase entirely in-house—from the initial 3D conceptualization to the final installation—we…</p>', 'Red Agave Landscape — landscaping in Austin | Fieseros', 'Book Red Agave Landscape for landscaping services in Austin. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (79 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:11:59.399Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 2, 'ChIJ8SFa_ci3RIYREmYVTrIiHfA', '2026-08-06T00:12:07.863Z', '2026-08-06T00:12:07.863Z')
