  VALUES ('cmsgrhpxkbli939gkd7g4', 'Rosa''s Maintenance Inc', 'rosas-maintenance-inc-391602', 'landscaping', '\+1 408-449-2784', NULL, 'http://rosasmaintenance.com/', '7193 Indian Valley Ct, San Jose, CA 95139', 'US', 'USD', 'San Jose', 'CA', '95139', 37.223973, -121.77397800000001, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.8, 52, 'Rosa''s Maintenance Inc — landscaping in San Jose', '<p>Established in 2000, quality is paramount at Rosa''s Maintenance Inc. and that''s why we continue to attract landscaping customers from all over Santa Clara County. In short, we know what we''re doing, provide exceptional customer service, and always execute landscaping jobs as promised.</p>
