<p>Residential and commercial clients have very different sets of demands, but our professional team members are fully capable of dealing with both. When we meet with you for the first time, we''ll work with you to locate all of the potential problems and tailor our strategy to keep these issues to a minimum.</p>
<p>At Rosa''s Maintenance Inc, what separates us from our competition is the fact that we excel at every aspect of the landscaping business. The…</p>', 'Rosa''s Maintenance Inc — landscaping in San Jose | Fieseros', 'Book Rosa''s Maintenance Inc for landscaping services in San Jose. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (52 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:12:30.728Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 8, 'ChIJ0ZlGd6MvjoARypb-uvtf9Po', '2026-08-06T00:12:35.794Z', '2026-08-06T00:12:35.794Z')
