<p>John Castello owner operator has been a Landscape Contractor sinse 2005 and serving the local community ever since.</p>
<p>Many College Athletic Fields that use real grass use Bermuda Grass for the water savings with a fall over seed of Ryegrass for the dormant season.</p>
<p>Bermuda Grass in our Zone 9 only requires "1 inch of water once a week compared to Fescue''s "6 inches of water per week. Which accounts for significant water savings.</p>
<p>We can seed a new Bermuda water savings lawn in Spring/ cool summer below 80 degrees and Fall season.</p>', 'Castello Landscape Construction — landscaping in San Jose | Fieseros', 'Book Castello Landscape Construction for landscaping services in San Jose. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (2 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:12:36.824Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 12, 'ChIJJX7zke8yjoAR3sDpUYUcLlI', '2026-08-06T00:12:40.492Z', '2026-08-06T00:12:40.492Z')
