<p>Our in-house irrigation experts combine technical proficiency with extensive horticultural knowledge to guarantee the plants in your landscape get the exact amount of moisture to thrive.</p>
<p>A well designed landscape fuses tranquil beauty with respect for the environment. Maintaining that balance requires a deep knowledge of plants and diligent effort. Our highly trained staff of landscape maintenance experts provide year round care. Expert mowing, trimming, and feeding promote a thriving green space. We can also maintain your outdoor spaces. We clean gutters, fountains, gas lanterns and other lighting fixtures. We even offer pooper scooper service. Our goal is to create a carefree respite for you and your family.</p>', 'Cody Landscape — landscaping in Fort Worth | Fieseros', 'Book Cody Landscape for landscaping services in Fort Worth. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (39 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:13:15.306Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 2, 'ChIJGy8r6tYMToYRl6vtZDfMke0', '2026-08-06T00:13:25.671Z', '2026-08-06T00:13:25.671Z')
