<p>New-construction luxury home, untouched lot. We delivered a complete landscape package: 18-zone sprinkler system, full new sod, drainage, artificial turf, decorative white marble rock, water wall feature, and full landscape beds — coordinated as a single build.</p>
<p>Most backyard projects fail because nobody draws the whole thing first. We build the plan together, line up the budget to scope, then run a single, coordinated build from breaking ground to the day you fire up the grill.</p>
<p>We sit down on your back porch, look at the space, and listen. How do you want to use it? Who''s it for? What''s been…</p>', 'DFW Landscaping & Lawn Care — landscaping in Fort Worth | Fieseros', 'Book DFW Landscaping & Lawn Care for landscaping services in Fort Worth. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (56 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:13:16.816Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 13, 'ChIJD6VhvljVTYYRI7qGIpwhmzU', '2026-08-06T00:13:25.671Z', '2026-08-06T00:13:25.671Z')
