<p>Paver patios are built to last. We offer several different sizes, unique shapes, patterns and colors that are fade resistant. Paver patios provide low and easy maintenance.</p>
<p>Natural stone patios offer timeless beauty and unmatched character. Each stone features unique colors, textures, and patterns, creating a one-of-a-kind outdoor living space.</p>
<p>A well-designed outdoor space goes beyond one feature. We bring together patios, seating areas, structures, lighting, and surrounding elements to create an extension of your home.</p>
<p>From built-in grills and prep areas to seating and entertaining spaces, we design outdoor kitchens that make hosting easier and extend how you use your home.</p>
<p>Whether you''re looking for a cozy backyard fire pit or a stunning natural stone fireplace, we have the expertise to bring your vision to life. Contact us today to get your consultation.</p>', 'Ciminello''s Landscape Design — landscaping in Westerville | Fieseros', 'Book Ciminello''s Landscape Design for landscaping services in Westerville. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.6★ (48 reviews)', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:13:36.924Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 11, 'ChIJH8RIEUuPOIgRa5w9vxq7YMo', '2026-08-06T00:13:44.922Z', '2026-08-06T00:13:44.922Z')
