<p>Hedge Landscape where family values meet exceptional landscaping expertise. Our journey began with Andrew Hedge, and as the demand for top-notch landscape construction grew, he brought his talented brothers on board to help manage and expand the business. What started as a family venture has evolved into a thriving landscape company with a…</p>', 'Hedge Landscape LLC — landscaping in Columbus | Fieseros', 'Book Hedge Landscape LLC for landscaping services in Columbus. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.5★ (18 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:13:38.120Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 10, 'ChIJsV5rcY31OIgRrpv0TGrLf1Y', '2026-08-06T00:13:44.922Z', '2026-08-06T00:13:44.922Z')
