<p>We used Crown Town Landscapes to enhance our yard and they exceeded our expectations! From hardscape work making our front entryway and back patio more elevated to a low maintenance yet visually interesting landscape plan, our yard now matches our style and home. The team was incredibly professional and knowledgeable finishing work on time and to plan. We can''t recommend them enough!</p>
<p>Excellent landscaping service with an emphasis on eco friendly choices. Friendly and responsive team to work with. Overall they did a great job rehabilitating our yard, amending the soil, planting trees and shrubs and installing raised beds.</p>
<p>Crown Town Landscapes built my beautiful raised garden bed in May 2022. They filled it with rich soil and vegetable/herb plants. This bed made gardening with my grandson a joy all summer and fall. We enjoyed the tasty harvest and…</p>', 'Crown Town Landscapes — landscaping in Charlotte | Fieseros', 'Book Crown Town Landscapes for landscaping services in Charlotte. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (52 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:13:57.072Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 14, 'ChIJUbxYaH-T8AoRSArwIMdRXa8', '2026-08-06T00:14:00.761Z', '2026-08-06T00:14:00.761Z')
