  VALUES ('cmsgrjonqxwa4865xwg36', 'CCR Backyard Design Inc.', 'ccr-backyard-design-inc-18946b', 'landscaping', '\+1 704-578-5240', NULL, 'http://www.ccrbackyarddesign.com/', '2725 Westinghouse Blvd #400, Charlotte, NC 28273', 'US', 'USD', 'Charlotte', 'NC', '28273', 35.1314517, -80.95122669999999, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 5, 40, 'CCR Backyard Design Inc. — landscaping in Charlotte', '<p>It all begins with an idea. From concept to creation, CCR Backyard Design transforms your outdoor dreams into breathtaking reality. Our gallery showcases the artistry of possibility—beautiful spaces where families gather, memories are made, and nature is celebrated. Each project tells a unique story of collaboration between homeowner vision and expert craftsmanship. Browse our collection of custom patios, cozy fire features, custom designed outdoor kitchens and elegant outdoor living spaces to inspire your own backyard transformation.</p>
<p>CCR Backyard Design and owner Corey Rowley have quietly grown to become the premier organization in the Charlotte area to add beauty, value, and quality of life to the exterior of your home. With over 20 years of experience in landscaping, installation, and design, CCR Backyard Design has the experience and know-how to install your project with the utmost care and maximum attention to detail. Customer satisfaction will always remain our #1 Priority from our design staff to our certified installers.</p>
