  VALUES ('cmsgrk1332l9qeu73ajb2', 'Paredes Landscaping', 'paredes-landscaping-9eb5f9', 'landscaping', '\+1 650-203-6590', NULL, 'https://www.sanmateolandscaper.com/', '784 Easton Ave, San Bruno, CA 94066', 'US', 'USD', 'San Bruno', 'CA', '94066', 37.629341499999995, -122.41395329999999, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.6, 23, 'Paredes Landscaping — landscaping in San Bruno', '<p>Welcome to Paredes Landscaping Inc, your premier choice for exceptional landscaping and hardscaping services in the San Mateo County. Serving the Peninsula area of the San Francisco Bay region, we are committed to creating beautiful, functional outdoor spaces that meet the unique needs and preferences of our clients. With a focus on customer satisfaction, attention to detail, and quality craftsmanship, our team of skilled professionals is dedicated to bringing your outdoor vision to life.</p>
<p>Whether you’re looking to enhance your property’s curb appeal with stunning landscaping features or create a relaxing outdoor living space with custom hardscaping elements, we have the expertise and experience to exceed your expectations. From design to installation and maintenance, we offer a comprehensive range of services that can transform your property into an inviting and enjoyable space for years to come.</p>
<p>At Paredes Landscaping Inc, we understand the importance of a well-maintained outdoor space in enhancing the overall value and appeal of your property. That’s why we use only the highest quality materials and equipment, and work closely with you to ensure that every…</p>', 'Paredes Landscaping — landscaping in San Bruno | Fieseros', 'Book Paredes Landscaping for landscaping services in San Bruno. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.6★ (23 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:14:18.495Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 12, 'ChIJT8-qnr7asEcRN_u0SpD1VtM', '2026-08-06T00:14:28.738Z', '2026-08-06T00:14:28.738Z')
