  VALUES ('cmsgrkokz67ohyz5jepr9', 'Lee''s General Landscaping and Yard Clean Up', 'lees-general-landscaping-and-yard-clean--0d98f9', 'landscaping', '\+1 206-312-2445', NULL, 'http://www.leesgenerallandscaping.com/', '12224 5th Ave S, Seattle, WA 98168', 'US', 'USD', 'Seattle', 'WA', '98168', 47.4931786, -122.3261227, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.8, 218, 'Lee''s General Landscaping and Yard Clean Up — landscaping in Seattle', '<p>For over 30 years, Seattle homeowners have trusted us to deliver fast scheduling and professional landscaping results — across 6,000+ homes.</p>
<p>Services: Paver patios, walkways, retaining walls, fencing, edging, garden beds, fire pits, irrigation systems, concrete work, landscape lighting, artificial turf, excavation, grading, custom decks, drainage solutions, and hardscape repairs. Custom CAD landscape design also available upon request.</p>
<p>Full service: weeding, natural pruning, shrub trimming, mowing, edging, raking, pressure washing, planting, mulch and bark installation, gravel, soil amendment, landscape fabric, and full yard waste removal. One-time cleanups, quarterly, overgrown yards, invasive plant removal, low-maintenance landscaping, home sale prep, commercial properties, insurance claim work, ongoing property improvements.</p>
<p>Schedule: One-time, biweekly maintenance, or annual yard care. Services: mowing, edging, weeding, raking, trimming, pruning, and leaf blowing. Lawn Care: sod installation, dethatching, aeration, hydroseeding, overseeding, fertilization, irrigation systems, and weed control.</p>
<p>Excellent work. I would highly recommend Lee''s to…</p>', 'Lee''s General Landscaping and Yard Clean Up — landscaping in Seattle ', 'Book Lee''s General Landscaping and Yard Clean Up for landscaping services in Seattle. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:14:48.947Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 11, 'ChIJuUGC8KJDkFQRH2t5BYL_k3M', '2026-08-06T00:14:56.006Z', '2026-08-06T00:14:56.006Z')
