  VALUES ('cmsgrkokwd0ec0ua0z6y6', 'North East Landscaping & Design', 'north-east-landscaping-design-d42dc0', 'landscaping', '\+1 206-608-2614', 'jcm@northeastls.com', 'https://www.northeastls.com/seattle-wa', '4311 11th Ave NE Ste 525, Seattle, WA 98105', 'US', 'USD', 'Seattle', 'WA', '98105', 47.660428200000005, -122.31692369999998, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.9, 124, 'North East Landscaping & Design — landscaping in Seattle', '<p>A landscape designer in Seattle, WA helps homeowners shape outdoor spaces that feel personal, complete, and built for Northwest living. Our landscaping services consider drainage, soil health, microclimates, and how you want to use your space. From concept drawings to material selections and finished construction, we create outdoor environments that look natural and function seamlessly throughout the seasons. Whether you’re planning a full backyard renovation or a simple layout refresh, thoughtful landscaping brings structure, balance, and long-term value to your property.</p>
<p>A paver patio in Seattle, WA brings everyday function and comfort to your home. Our team designs patios that feel connected to your architecture and lifestyle, selecting pavers suited for Seattle’s climate and your preferred look. Whether you picture a quiet morning coffee spot or a larger gathering space, each patio is engineered for longevity with proper base prep, drainage considerations, and refined finishing work. We build paver patios that stay level, strong, and visually cohesive year after year.</p>
<p>Sod installation in Seattle, WA provides an instant, finished lawn that elevates curb…</p>', 'North East Landscaping & Design — landscaping in Seattle | Fieseros', 'Book North East Landscaping & Design for landscaping services in Seattle. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (124 reviews)', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:14:48.944Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 9, 'ChIJHf_AiCcVkFQRcf8Lzp8_KCI', '2026-08-06T00:14:56.006Z', '2026-08-06T00:14:56.006Z')
