<p>Green Spaces Landscaping is your partner that specializes in designing and building projects throughout the greater Seattle and Eastside area. Our focus is on multi-faceted outdoor spaces; such as, a paver patio, retaining wall(s), and landscaping . We partner with our clients through superior communication to understand your goals and desired outcomes and help realize an outdoor space the exceeds your expectations. Our design team and in-house craftsmen are here to make your outdoor dreams into long lasting memories.</p>
<p>Once you contact our team, we will ask guided questions to better understand your expectations to ensure we are the best match.</p>
