<p>Your designer will complete a detailed site analysis to understand your outdoor space.</p>
<p>We will take your feedback and our discussion about the design concepts and investment ranges to produce a color-rendered plan view design.</p>', 'Green Spaces Landscaping — landscaping in Redmond | Fieseros', 'Book Green Spaces Landscaping for landscaping services in Redmond. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (77 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:14:50.980Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 9, 'ChIJ7ceTXmcOkFQRO0W_dyL65DQ', '2026-08-06T00:14:56.007Z', '2026-08-06T00:14:56.007Z')
