  VALUES ('cmsgrkvd3xbk9ou1kwuxz', 'Augusta Lawn Care Services', 'augusta-lawn-care-services-92f5b1', 'landscaping', '+1 206-880-2040', 'wseattle@augustalawncareservices.com', 'https://augustalawncareservices.com/wseattle', '4844 Puget Blvd SW, Seattle, WA 98106', 'US', 'USD', 'Seattle', 'WA', '98106', 47.5579733, -122.3612275, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.9, 58, 'Augusta Lawn Care Services — landscaping in Seattle', '<p>Choosing Augusta Lawn Care of West Seattle means more than just a well maintained lawn; it''s about experiencing the highest standards in professional lawn care. Our expert team is dedicated to providing comprehensive services, including meticulous mowing, thorough landscape maintenance, creative softscape installations, gutter cleaning and essential seasonal yard cleanups. These services ensure your property remains beautiful and healthy throughout the year. By relying on our expertise, you save precious time and money, allowing you to enjoy your outdoor space without the hassle. Our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction shines through in every project we undertake, transforming ordinary yards into extraordinary landscapes. Serving both West Seattle and White Center, Augusta Lawn Care stands out for its customer centric approach and unwavering dedication to exceptional results. Let us help you unlock the full potential of your lawn with our tailored, high quality services.</p>
<p>Professional lawn care services typically include lawn mowing, edging, string trimming, blowing off hard surfaces, and ongoing landscape maintenance to keep grass healthy and properties…</p>', 'Augusta Lawn Care Services — landscaping in Seattle | Fieseros', 'Book Augusta Lawn Care Services for landscaping services in Seattle. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (58 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:14:57.735Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 3, 'ChIJtQZYs42u5Y0RLod0e1dwPik', '2026-08-06T00:15:03.179Z', '2026-08-06T00:15:03.179Z')
