  VALUES ('cmsgrl5zn4tifx2sx55s2', 'AGR Landscape & Construction', 'agr-landscape-construction-97e8d6', 'landscaping', '\+1 720-441-9011', 'sales@agrlandscaping.com', 'https://www.agrlandscaping.com/', '1160 W Virginia Ave, Denver, CO 80223', 'US', 'USD', 'Denver', 'CO', '80223', 39.7073001, -105.0007756, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.7, 95, 'AGR Landscape & Construction — landscaping in Denver', '<p>We don''t just talk about quality of our work, we build it in our showroom. Every element, from pavers to our Pergola, our showroom is a full-scale preview of what you can expect in your own outdoor space. Trust starts when you see the work with your own eyes.</p>
