<p>At Duke''s Landscape Company, we are dedicated to transforming outdoor spaces into beautiful and functional environments. From custom patios to luxurious pools, we offer a wide range of services designed to elevate your outdoor living experience, including:</p>
<p>Our team specializes in creating beautiful, long-lasting decks using top-quality PVC and composite materials. Whether you''re looking to expand your outdoor space or reinvigorate your home’s exterior, our expert craftsmanship ensures your deck will be both stunning and durable, providing the perfect setting for gatherings and relaxation year-round.</p>
<p>Create the perfect outdoor retreat with a custom patio in Golden, CO, tailored to your unique style and needs. Whether you envision a cozy space for family gatherings or a sleek, modern patio for entertaining, our team of skilled designers will bring your vision to life. Using premium materials and innovative design, we craft patios that are both functional and…</p>', 'Duke’s Landscape Company — landscaping in Golden | Fieseros', 'Book Duke’s Landscape Company for landscaping services in Golden. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (44 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:15:21.920Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 8, 'ChIJAzY4o2_8fq4RdfvRLrMb02U', '2026-08-06T00:15:30.462Z', '2026-08-06T00:15:30.462Z')
