<p>We also provide fast irrigation repair to keep your sprinkler system working properly and protect your landscape investment. With expert design and skilled installation, we help ensure your property looks its best throughout the year.</p>
<p>Transform your Nashville property with our expert landscaping team and create the outdoor space of your dreams.</p>
<p>Imagine an outdoor space that perfectly reflects your vision. Our experts provide comprehensive Landscape Design , Plant Installation , and Grading services to create functional and beautiful outdoor environments. From intricate garden layouts to seamless outdoor living areas, we bring your landscaping dreams to life with creativity and precision.</p>', 'GeoScapes — landscaping in Nashville | Fieseros', 'Book GeoScapes for landscaping services in Nashville. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (69 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:16:03.520Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 11, 'ChIJRQnBbMxpZIgR8PAvQnClP0g', '2026-08-06T00:16:08.956Z', '2026-08-06T00:16:08.956Z')
