  VALUES ('cmsgrne9ebx57gjxr49wn', 'NYC Window Air Conditioner Installation and Delivery by SuperCoolNYC', 'nyc-window-air-conditioner-installation--b4152a', 'landscaping', '\+1 929-400-7665', NULL, 'http://www.supercoolnyc.com/', '45 Allen St, New York, NY 10002', 'US', 'USD', 'New York', 'NY', '10002', 40.7166341, -73.9922551, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.9, 120, 'NYC Window Air Conditioner Installation and Delivery by SuperCoolNYC — landscaping in New York', '<p>​ SuperCoolNYC is a New York City based window air conditioner installation service started by teachers in 2010. We have been featured in New York Magazine''s "the Strategist!" We install window AC units in the bottom of windows that slide up and down for New Yorkers in Manhattan, Brooklyn and some parts of Queens. We can install an AC unit you own or we can deliver one right to your door and install it for you all in one visit! Fully licensed and insured. We are the most convenient window air conditioner service in NYC!</p>
