  VALUES ('cmsgrofhtk04icpdasobx', 'TDH Mechanical, Heating and Cooling Contractors', 'tdh-mechanical-heating-and-cooling-contr-5f1be8', 'landscaping', '\+1 773-342-4338', NULL, 'https://www.chicagotdhmechanical.com/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp', '1623 W Montrose Ave, Chicago, IL 60613', 'US', 'USD', 'Chicago', 'IL', '60613', 41.9614073, -87.6702418, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.7, 175, 'TDH Mechanical, Heating and Cooling Contractors — landscaping in Chicago', '<p>Every piece of equipment has its time, and HVAC systems are no exception. Generally, AC units last about 15 years even with impeccable maintenance. Older units can also be real energy drains. When the time comes for a replacement, TDH Mechanical stands by to assist. With 38 years in the business, we''re masters of AC replacements. Reach out at (773) 342-4338 for a free AC installation quote in Chicago.</p>
