<p>The challenges faced by AC units in Chicago are undeniable. And, like any hard-working machine, they requires periodic care. Our all-inclusive AC maintenance services are here to provide just that. Annual check-ups ensure longevity, efficiency, and the prevention of surprise malfunctions during the hottest days. Keen to explore our HVAC maintenance…</p>', 'TDH Mechanical, Heating and Cooling Contractors — landscaping in Chic', 'Book TDH Mechanical, Heating and Cooling Contractors for landscaping services in Chicago. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:17:43.793Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 7, 'ChIJm5Mah6jTD4gR79fjTHKUsI8', '2026-08-06T00:17:51.074Z', '2026-08-06T00:17:51.074Z')
