<p>Prompt AC repairs address these issues by fixing worn-out parts, cleaning clogged filters, and checking for proper refrigerant levels. By addressing these…</p>', 'Vibrant Mechanical — landscaping in Houston | Fieseros', 'Book Vibrant Mechanical for landscaping services in Houston. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (212 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:18:23.820Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 11, 'ChIJG1ASs2StQIYR2wTQ7PeDlgw', '2026-08-06T00:18:32.461Z', '2026-08-06T00:18:32.461Z')
