<p>In Houston, TX, we work according to the regulations and preferences of the client. Customer support is provided at all stages, allowing us to quickly and efficiently resolve any issues you may have with your home heating. The service is provided at a convenient time for the client.</p>', 'H-Town AC Repair HVAC services Houston — landscaping in Houston | Fie', 'Book H-Town AC Repair HVAC services Houston for landscaping services in Houston. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (295 r', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:18:24.423Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 7, 'ChIJHcb8fZq_QIYRxAKIEUiSL7E', '2026-08-06T00:18:32.461Z', '2026-08-06T00:18:32.461Z')
