<p>Our full range of services includes AC repair and replacement, furnace and heat pump repair, ductwork and duct cleaning, smart thermostats, air purification, and preventive maintenance plans that help…</p>', 'Diamond AC and Heating — landscaping in Phoenix | Fieseros', 'Book Diamond AC and Heating for landscaping services in Phoenix. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.5★ (698 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:18:55.350Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 8, 'ChIJ-7xtr5pvK4cRZJryC7Km5dA', '2026-08-06T00:19:05.146Z', '2026-08-06T00:19:05.146Z')
