<p>Green Heating, Cooling, & Electric is proud to offer the best heater repair and AC repair in Philadelphia, Bucks County, Montgomery County and New Jersey. Our expert HVAC contractors can tackle all of your HVAC needs whether it is a residential or commercial property, we can install a new HVAC system in your home or replace your old boiler at your commercial property. Our HVAC repair services are backed by a workmanship guarantee, so your satisfaction is assured each and every time.</p>
<p>We were named the winner of Angie’s List Super Service Award our air conditioning repair and HVAC service has received multiple accolades, so you can be sure that your home is always in great hands. We…</p>', 'Green Heating, Cooling & Electric - AC Repair, Furnace Repair & HVAC —', 'Book Green Heating, Cooling & Electric - AC Repair, Furnace Repair & HVAC for landscaping services in Philadelphia. Professional, reliable, and trusted by', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T00:19:26.104Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 3, 'ChIJmwGMRJi2xokR82kptffmkvc', '2026-08-06T00:19:29.509Z', '2026-08-06T00:19:29.509Z')
